# Needs the dev test stock (TST). Places one limit buy (no days advanced) and cancels it.
name new orders stay open for the Options lifetime (90 days by default): the ticket says so and the Your Portfolio card counts down from it
set-price TST 100
show-buy TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 5
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 90
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitHint Good for 90 days
capture order-lifetime-ticket
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order 90 days left
capture order-lifetime-card
cleanup:
cancel-new-orders
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
close-economy
